 "events": [
  {
   "id": "welcome",
   "type": "enter_talk",
   "building": "baisodrome",
   "npc": "Tanukichi",
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": {
      "fr": "{3.15:}Oh !{7.0:0a000000} {3.3:}Bienvenue, bienvenue\nau {0.3:0200}Baisodrome{0.3:ffff} !{0.4:}{3.1:}Le tout premier hôtel de charme\nde {5.5:}, oui, oui.{7.0:0a000000}\nSept suites à thème !{0.4:}{3.21:}La suite {0.3:0200}Lovely{0.3:ffff}, toute en\ndentelle et en petits cœurs,\npour les romantiques.{0.4:}{3.1:}La {0.3:0200}Nuptiale{0.3:ffff}, pour les jeunes\nmariés{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}. ou pour ceux qui\nfont semblant, hm ?{0.4:}{3.26:}Le {0.3:0200}Donjon{0.3:ffff}{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:0a000000} Fouets,\nmenottes, balançoire en cuir.\nJe ne pose pas de questions.{0.4:}{3.38:}Le {0.3:0200}Disco{0.3:ffff} et sa barre de\npole dance, le {0.3:0200}Spa{0.3:ffff} et son\njacuzzi en forme de cœur !{0.4:}{3.5:}La {0.3:0200}Panthère{0.3:ffff} pour les fauves.{7.0:0a000000}\nEt la {0.3:0200}Vibro{0.3:ffff}{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}. {3.23:}son lit\nvibre pour 100 clochettes.{0.4:}{3.11:}Les capotes sont au\ndistributeur, près du Donjon.{7.0:0a000000}\n{3.1:}La sécurité avant tout !{0.4:}{3.38:}Et surtout{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}. {0.3:0200}discrétion\nabsolue{0.3:ffff} ! Ce qui se passe\nici reste ici, oui, oui.{0.4:}{3.26:}Hem{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:0a000000} Les tarifs sont\naffichés. Je fais crédit,\nbien sûr. Avec intérêts.{0.4:}{3.1:}Choisis ta chambre.{7.0:0a000000}\nEt n'hésite pas à amener\nquelqu'un, hm ?",
      "en": "{3.15:}Oh!{7.0:0a000000} {3.3:}Welcome, welcome\nto the {0.3:0200}Baisodrome{0.3:ffff}!{0.4:}{3.1:}{5.5:}'s very first love\nhotel, yes, yes.{7.0:0a000000}\nSeven themed suites!{0.4:}{3.21:}The {0.3:0200}Lovely{0.3:ffff} suite, all lace\nand little hearts, for the\nromantics.{0.4:}{3.1:}The {0.3:0200}Bridal{0.3:ffff} suite, for the\nnewlyweds{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}. or for those\nwho pretend, hm?{0.4:}{3.26:}The {0.3:0200}Dungeon{0.3:ffff}{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:0a000000} Whips,\nhandcuffs, a leather swing.\nI ask no questions.{0.4:}{3.38:}The {0.3:0200}Disco{0.3:ffff} with its pole,\nthe {0.3:0200}Spa{0.3:ffff} with its\nheart-shaped jacuzzi!{0.4:}{3.5:}The {0.3:0200}Panther{0.3:ffff} for wild ones.{7.0:0a000000}\nAnd the {0.3:0200}Vibro{0.3:ffff}{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}. {3.23:}its bed\nshakes for 100 Bells.{0.4:}{3.11:}Condoms are in the machine\nby the Dungeon.{7.0:0a000000}\n{3.1:}Safety first!{0.4:}{3.38:}And above all{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}. {0.3:0200}total\ndiscretion{0.3:ffff}! What happens\nhere stays here, yes.{0.4:}{3.26:}Ahem{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:08000000}.{7.0:0a000000} The rates are on\nthe board. I give credit,\nof course. With interest.{0.4:}{3.1:}Pick a room.{7.0:0a000000}\nAnd don't hesitate to bring\nsomeone, hm?"
     }
    }
   ],
   "goodbye": {
    "en": "{3.1:}Thank you, and see you soon at\nthe Baisodrome, hm?",
    "fr": "{3.1:}Merci, et à très bientôt au\nBaisodrome, hm ?"
   }
  }
 ]
}